                                                "sense_id": "9c701f9b-55c6-3092-9ba1-e1555b4f7681",
                                                "text": "\"Sure thing, I buffed her, and they turfed her to urology, but she bounced back to me!\" [...] They attempted to transfer her to urology by modifying her chart (buffing it) to request urine tests, but the doctors in urology sent (bounced) her back."
